WEBVTT

act-1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.152
Your agent remembers an answer but not where it came from.
You: When was the primary endpoint measured?
Agent: 12 weeks, I think. I can't point you to the source.

act-2
00:00:04.452 --> 00:00:08.152
Oh
Agent memory that shows its work.

act-3
00:00:08.452 --> 00:00:13.852
Oh saves each answer with the evidence behind it.

act-4
00:00:14.152 --> 00:00:21.184
Every change is logged, and oh verify replays the log to check it.

act-5
00:00:21.484 --> 00:00:25.724
It all stays in one file on your machine.

end
